{"seq":219,"slug":"dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance","title":"危险品仓（DG Warehouse）资质、分区存储与作业合规","stage":"DONE","category":"global-ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance","rating":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 危险品仓（DG Warehouse）资质、分区存储与作业合规导论 简介\n\n跨境电商的货盘里从来不缺「带电、带液、带压力」的商品——锂电池手机与充电宝、香水与含酒精化妆品、气雾剂、打火机、带磁铁的扬声器。它们在消费者眼中只是普通商品，在仓储合规眼中却是受 UN 编号、危险类别与包装等级严格约束的危险货物。把普通仓的作业逻辑直接套到这些 SKU 上，轻则在消防检查中被要求停业整改，重则因混存、超量或泄漏酿成火灾爆炸事故。本 hub 讲的就是把一个普通跨境仓变成**合法、可审计、可系统化运转的危险品仓（DG Warehouse）**所必须打通的合规闭环：从一件货「是不是危品、能不能存」，到仓库「凭什么资质、怎么分区」，再到日常「怎么收、怎么存、怎么发」，以及出事之后「怎么应急、危废怎么走、怎么复盘」。\n\n这个 hub 面向跨境履约与仓储系统的工程师、WMS 产品经理、EHS（环境健康安全）与关务合规人员。四章构成一条从准入到兜底的递进链。第一章解决**识别与可存性**：用 UN 编号、危险类别（Class/Division）与包装等级（PG）识别货物，用相容性矩阵回答两类危品能不能相邻存放，并把 SDS、UN 标签这些外部凭证落成可计算的危品基础数据。第二章解决**场所资质与物理分区**：危化品经营许可、消防与环评审批的取证路径，隔离/隔开/分离三级分区与防火间距，以及「实际存在量 ≤ 许可储量 ≤ 设计储量」的上限管控。第三章解决**日常作业**：收货核验与专区上架、在库温湿度监控与账实盘点、危品拣货复核与合规装车，把前两章的静态规则变成每一笔出入库的实时校验。第四章解决**应急与退出**：泄漏火灾的应急预案与演练、危险废物收集转移与处置台账，以及用合规审核、事故复盘和 KPI 度量让整个体系持续改进。\n\n读者从这里开始应带着一条主线往下走：**危险品仓储合规的本质，是把「不相容」「超量」「无证」「断链」四类风险，在系统里做成不可绕过的前置约束，而不是依赖现场人员的记忆与自觉**。本 hub 引用的 UN/IMDG/IATA/ADR 规则版本、GB 强制标准条款与许可储量等数值均可能随修订与属地口径变化，落地时以现行有效版本和当地应急、消防、生态环境部门意见为准；本 hub 提供的是工程化建模框架，不替代第三方安全评价机构与持证安全管理人员的专业判定。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dg-classification-storable","title":"危品分类与可存性","docCount":3,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-classification-storable","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dg-un-number-class-division","title":"UN 编号、危险货物类别与包装等级","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-classification-storable/dg-un-number-class-division"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dg-warehouse-acceptability-rule","title":"仓库可存性判定与相容性矩阵","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-classification-storable/dg-warehouse-acceptability-rule"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dg-sds-label-data-model","title":"SDS、UN 标签与危品基础数据建模","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-classification-storable/dg-sds-label-data-model"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"dg-warehouse-license-layout","title":"危仓资质与分区","docCount":3,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-warehouse-license-layout","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dg-warehouse-license-approval","title":"危仓资质、消防环评与审批取证","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-warehouse-license-layout/dg-warehouse-license-approval"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dg-zone-segregation-isolation","title":"库区隔离、隔离距离与兼容分区规划","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-warehouse-license-layout/dg-zone-segregation-isolation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dg-storage-quantity-licensing-cap","title":"存储量分级与许可上限管控","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-warehouse-license-layout/dg-storage-quantity-licensing-cap"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"dg-inventory-operation","title":"危品出入库作业","docCount":3,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-inventory-operation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dg-inbound-inspection-putaway","title":"危品收货核验与专区上架","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-inventory-operation/dg-inbound-inspection-putaway"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dg-storage-inventory-reconciliation","title":"在库监控、温湿度与账实盘点","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-inventory-operation/dg-storage-inventory-reconciliation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dg-outbound-picking-vehicle-loading","title":"危品拣货复核与合规装车","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-inventory-operation/dg-outbound-picking-vehicle-loading"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"dg-emergency-waste","title":"应急与危废衔接","docCount":3,"url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-emergency-waste","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dg-emergency-response-drill","title":"泄漏与火灾应急预案及演练","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-emergency-waste/dg-emergency-response-drill"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dg-hazwaste-disposal-chain","title":"危废收集、转移联单与处置台账","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-emergency-waste/dg-hazwaste-disposal-chain"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dg-compliance-audit-incident-review","title":"合规审核、事故复盘与 KPI 度量","url":"/h/global-ecommerce/dangerous-goods-warehouse-compliance/dg-emergency-waste/dg-compliance-audit-incident-review"}]}]}